OL,3,ATrump ousts US ambassador to Greece
OL,4,Aafter allegations of corruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has asked the US
OL,7,FAmbassador to Greece Kimberly Guilfoyle
OL,8,Fto resign following allegations of
OL,9,Fmisconduct
OL,11,FGuilfoyle allegedly asked a Trump donor
OL,12,Fto pay her hefty credit card bill in
OL,13,Fexchange for access to his
OL,14,Fadministration
OL,16,FTrump says "she was doing a good job,
OL,17,Fbut we didn't like what we were
OL,18,Freading"
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
