OL,3,ATrump ousts US ambassador to Greece
OL,4,Aafter allegations of corruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Guilfoyle - the former
OL,7,Ffiancee of Donald Trump Jr - denies the
OL,8,Fclaims against her and vows to
OL,9,F"vigorously defend my name"
OL,11,FReports Guilfoyle would leave the post
OL,12,Fwere confirmed by Trump's new White
OL,13,FHouse Press Secretary Katie Zacharia in
OL,14,Fher first briefing to journalists,
OL,15,Fwhere she took just three questions
OL,17,FAsked for his verdict, Trump calls her
OL,18,Fperformance "very good"
